WEBVTT

00:00:25.670 --> 00:00:28.970
Gobble!! Guts!! Gobble!! Guts!! Gobble!!

00:00:30.810 --> 00:00:34.210
Gobble!! Guts!! Gobble!! Guts!! Gobble!!

00:00:36.410 --> 00:00:39.050
Calling everything delicious!

00:00:39.050 --> 00:00:43.550
The more I eat, the more powerful I get!

00:00:44.120 --> 00:00:46.920
Let’s capture ingredients around the world!

00:00:46.920 --> 00:00:51.500
I dream of being an invincible 
Gourmet Fighter!!

00:00:51.760 --> 00:00:56.530
Now on to the bottom of the 
sea, or the tops of glaciers!

00:00:56.530 --> 00:00:59.200
Jump! Jump Jump Jump! 
Knock! Knock Knock Knock!

00:00:59.200 --> 00:01:01.400
Give thanks!

00:01:01.400 --> 00:01:04.610
Let’s eat!

00:01:05.040 --> 00:01:10.410
Wow wo!! Spiked Punch! Wow wo!! Multi-fold!

00:01:10.410 --> 00:01:15.550
Guts! Gutsy Guts! I can eat any dream!

00:01:15.550 --> 00:01:20.820
Wow wo!! My very own... 
Wow wo!! ...Full Course!

00:01:21.090 --> 00:01:24.990
Guts! Gutsy Guts! Gather them all up!

00:01:24.990 --> 00:01:31.070
And put the world on my plate!

00:01:31.070 --> 00:01:33.870
Wow wow wow! Eat the mountains!!

00:01:33.870 --> 00:01:36.440
Wow wow wow! Toriko!!

00:01:36.440 --> 00:01:39.040
Wow wow wow! Eat the oceans!!

00:01:39.040 --> 00:01:43.310
Wow wow wow! Tori, Tori, Tori, Toriko!!

00:01:49.750 --> 00:01:52.220
Someone once said...

00:01:52.650 --> 00:01:57.690
There is a shepherd's purse plant upon 
which grows springy, baked hanpen

00:01:57.690 --> 00:02:00.560
that turns roasted brown on the outside

00:02:00.560 --> 00:02:04.030
and spongy on the inside when it's ripened...

00:02:04.600 --> 00:02:08.770
Shanpend's Purse!

00:02:11.010 --> 00:02:17.510
There are melons which have 
flesh as soft as caramel

00:02:17.510 --> 00:02:22.620
and are covered in sweet, 
fragrant caramel sauce...

00:02:22.620 --> 00:02:25.590
Caramelons!

00:02:26.650 --> 00:02:30.020
The world is in the Gourmet Age...

00:02:30.020 --> 00:02:35.430
An age in which people quest for 
yet unknown culinary delights!

00:02:37.500 --> 00:02:41.230
Separated from Toriko and Zebra, Komatsu 
made his way through the pyramid alone.

00:02:41.430 --> 00:02:44.600
Kid! Don't go that way!

00:02:49.080 --> 00:02:53.280
Sound Bazooka!

00:02:59.690 --> 00:03:00.590
Komatsu!

00:03:00.820 --> 00:03:02.450
Toriko-san!

00:03:03.220 --> 00:03:05.960
Finally, the three were reunited.

00:03:06.630 --> 00:03:11.460
Toriko noticed the smell of cola coming 
from within the body of a Beast.

00:03:11.460 --> 00:03:16.070
I'm positive. It's the master 
of the Gourmet Pyramid...

00:03:16.070 --> 00:03:18.070
Salamander Sphinx!

00:03:18.570 --> 00:03:21.510
Mellow Cola is inside its body!

00:03:21.970 --> 00:03:28.580
To get the cola, all we gotta 
do is bust this thing wide open!

00:03:39.260 --> 00:03:42.830
Meanwhile, Komatsu deciphered a recipe

00:03:42.830 --> 00:03:45.200
from a book that he'd found in the pyramid.

00:03:45.900 --> 00:03:47.230
It's tears!

00:03:48.430 --> 00:03:52.940
The tears of that Beast are Mellow Cola!

00:03:53.200 --> 00:03:55.470
How do you know that, kid?!

00:03:55.470 --> 00:03:57.740
It's in this book!

00:03:57.740 --> 00:04:02.050
Kid! Tell me exactly what to do.

00:04:05.120 --> 00:04:08.150
If you don't, I'll kill you!

00:04:08.150 --> 00:04:09.450
R-Right!

00:04:11.890 --> 00:04:13.820
Alright. Ready?!

00:04:24.400 --> 00:04:26.100
Let's go!

00:04:34.510 --> 00:04:36.410
Let the preparation begin!

00:04:37.080 --> 00:04:40.680
The three face the challenge 
of capturing Mellow Cola!

00:04:43.150 --> 00:04:48.220
Cooperative Cooking! Komatsu 
Manages Toriko and Zebra!

00:05:23.920 --> 00:05:28.460
So the Salamander Sphinx's tears are 
Mellow Cola! And now that we know it...

00:05:28.660 --> 00:05:31.230
Making Beasts cry is my specialty!

00:05:33.730 --> 00:05:36.600
Let's go! Tell us what to do, Komatsu!

00:05:37.200 --> 00:05:39.970
Right! Um...

00:05:48.280 --> 00:05:49.420
Toriko-san!

00:05:49.850 --> 00:05:52.690
Kid! What should we do first?!

00:05:52.690 --> 00:05:55.220
Will this thing cry if 
we hurt it any old way?!

00:05:56.520 --> 00:06:00.460
Hurry up and give us 
instructions! You're the cook!

00:06:00.460 --> 00:06:02.060
Pull yourself together!

00:06:27.990 --> 00:06:30.790
Let's begin preparing Mellow Cola!

00:06:31.460 --> 00:06:34.090
Yell it out, Komatsu!

00:06:34.390 --> 00:06:39.200
My ears aren't as sharp as Zebra's!

00:06:39.200 --> 00:06:40.030
Right!

00:06:40.570 --> 00:06:44.200
First off, pound its entire 
body from stem to stern!

00:06:44.570 --> 00:06:49.110
Make sure you hit the muscles so the 
fibers of the meat are tenderized!

00:06:49.110 --> 00:06:51.240
Use just the right amount of strength!

00:06:51.240 --> 00:06:55.950
It's gonna be tough hittin' this thing 
while dodging its rain of attacks!

00:06:55.950 --> 00:06:58.650
And you said to nail every 
last inch of its body?!

00:06:59.150 --> 00:07:01.250
I'll do it.

00:07:01.250 --> 00:07:03.550
Cover your ears.

00:07:03.850 --> 00:07:06.020
Komatsu! Cover your ears!

00:07:06.020 --> 00:07:08.030
They're already covered!

00:07:08.030 --> 00:07:08.990
That's my partner!

00:07:09.490 --> 00:07:16.170
Sound Bazooka!

00:07:36.150 --> 00:07:37.420
That's the way...

00:07:37.420 --> 00:07:40.360
It's getting tenderized, 
just as I imagine it.

00:07:40.890 --> 00:07:41.890
Alright!

00:07:41.890 --> 00:07:46.600
Next, the center of its chest! 
Hit in the solar plexus!

00:07:46.600 --> 00:07:48.130
Put a little strength into it!

00:07:49.600 --> 00:07:52.570
That trick cost him 400,000 kilocalories.

00:07:53.100 --> 00:07:57.840
He's got about 2,600,000 left! 
He'll be halfway empty soon!

00:07:58.540 --> 00:08:02.680
Alright, I'm gonna get in 
close. Cover me, Zebra!

00:08:13.590 --> 00:08:15.520
Sound Wall!

00:08:22.430 --> 00:08:23.730
I can't hold it!

00:08:36.140 --> 00:08:37.580
Right here, Komatsu?!

00:08:38.080 --> 00:08:39.750
A little more to the right!

00:08:39.750 --> 00:08:45.950
Alright! Tenfold Spiked Punch!

00:08:54.060 --> 00:08:56.800
That cost 300,000 kilocalories, huh?

00:09:03.800 --> 00:09:05.770
Toriko-san! Zebra-san!

00:09:05.770 --> 00:09:09.040
Komatsu! Concentrate on the preparations!

00:09:09.040 --> 00:09:10.940
The chef shouldn't lose his 
head over something like

00:09:10.940 --> 00:09:12.750
the ingredients putting up a fight!

00:09:13.180 --> 00:09:14.310
Toriko-san...

00:09:14.310 --> 00:09:17.820
Alright, let's continue cookin'!

00:09:17.820 --> 00:09:21.490
Think of us as your cooking tools, Komatsu!

00:09:21.490 --> 00:09:25.360
Toriko-san, Zebra-san, I appreciate this...

00:09:29.430 --> 00:09:31.130
Have to concentrate...

00:09:39.140 --> 00:09:42.170
I have faith in Toriko-san and Zebra-san!

00:09:42.940 --> 00:09:46.010
Next, slice off a few scales from its back!

00:09:46.280 --> 00:09:48.610
I can't do that with a normal Knife...

00:09:49.180 --> 00:09:52.580
I've got 1,900,000 kilocalories left.

00:09:52.580 --> 00:09:57.090
And Zebra's at 2,550,000 kilocalories...

00:09:57.090 --> 00:09:58.920
Against this tough ingredient,

00:09:58.920 --> 00:10:03.560
we'll have to guess how much prep time 
is left and then choose our attacks.

00:10:03.560 --> 00:10:06.130
Zebra! Get its attention!

00:10:06.660 --> 00:10:07.970
Got it!

00:10:12.400 --> 00:10:14.670
Leg Knife!

00:10:20.180 --> 00:10:24.010
500,000 kilocalories per kick is too much.

00:10:24.010 --> 00:10:26.650
I'm down to half my capacity of kilocalories.

00:10:26.650 --> 00:10:29.950
Not gonna be able to use Leg Knife anymore.

00:10:29.950 --> 00:10:32.020
Next, stab the bottom of its feet!

00:10:32.920 --> 00:10:34.930
Starting with its right 
foot and then clockwise!

00:10:34.930 --> 00:10:36.130
Leave it to me!

00:10:48.610 --> 00:10:51.840
That took about 100,000 kilocalories!

00:10:54.140 --> 00:10:58.980
Next, pluck one feather from each 
of its wings at the same time!

00:10:59.580 --> 00:11:01.520
At the same time, he says!

00:11:01.520 --> 00:11:03.950
Zebra! Follow my lead!

00:11:04.190 --> 00:11:08.320
As if, jackass! You follow <i>my</i> lead!

00:11:10.930 --> 00:11:12.760
Ready... set...

00:11:16.100 --> 00:11:17.130
Good!

00:11:17.130 --> 00:11:19.230
Its tear glands are swelling up!

00:11:20.100 --> 00:11:22.440
I think I'm starting to get it!

00:11:23.070 --> 00:11:26.840
Glucose from the prey that 
the Salamander Sphinx eats

00:11:26.840 --> 00:11:30.010
stores up in its tear glands.

00:11:30.410 --> 00:11:34.920
And the one time each year that 
it empties those glands is now!

00:11:35.620 --> 00:11:40.020
When the sea turtle lays its 
eggs, it appears to cry,

00:11:40.020 --> 00:11:43.890
but it's really expelling an 
excess of salt from its body.

00:11:43.890 --> 00:11:46.460
In the same way, this Beast is about to expel

00:11:46.460 --> 00:11:49.100
a large amount of glucose 
from its tear glands.

00:11:49.600 --> 00:11:53.230
That glucose is the source 
of the Mellow Cola!

00:11:54.030 --> 00:11:59.410
If we follow the recipe and stimulate 
its body before it expels the glucose,

00:11:59.410 --> 00:12:03.310
the CO2 in its body will dissolve into 
the tears, becoming carbonic acid,

00:12:03.310 --> 00:12:05.450
and the Mellow Cola will be complete.

00:12:06.380 --> 00:12:08.820
I see the food at the end of the tunnel!

00:12:08.820 --> 00:12:13.250
Just a little more! Toriko-san! 
Zebra-san! Keep at it!

00:12:13.250 --> 00:12:14.190
Yeah!

00:12:14.920 --> 00:12:18.190
Take the stiffness out of its shoulder 
muscles from the inner side!

00:12:19.660 --> 00:12:21.430
Sound Wall!

00:12:26.100 --> 00:12:31.600
Flying Fork!

00:12:42.010 --> 00:12:44.780
I don't care if you cut 
off its stretchy mane!

00:12:44.780 --> 00:12:46.790
What the hell?! You should've 
said that before!

00:12:47.090 --> 00:12:49.920
Voice Cutter!

00:12:54.360 --> 00:12:56.360
Komatsu! What's next?!

00:12:56.360 --> 00:12:57.030
Right!

00:13:43.970 --> 00:13:46.110
Man, this sucker's tough...

00:13:46.740 --> 00:13:50.050
After all that, it's finally settled down.

00:13:50.050 --> 00:13:52.680
Toriko-san! Zebra-san!

00:13:53.620 --> 00:13:58.790
The last step! Hit the end of 
its tail as hard as you can!

00:14:04.990 --> 00:14:09.200
15-fold Spiked Punch!

00:14:06.300 --> 00:14:11.100
Voice Missile!

00:14:35.320 --> 00:14:37.290
It's coming out!

00:14:56.040 --> 00:14:57.250
We...

00:15:21.970 --> 00:15:25.910
Komatsu!!

00:15:58.200 --> 00:16:02.540
I-I'm... all outta energy!

00:16:40.950 --> 00:16:42.450
Komatsu...

00:16:49.950 --> 00:16:51.360
Kid...

00:16:53.860 --> 00:16:57.860
Come to think of it, I didn't decide 
what I wanted for my reward...

00:16:58.860 --> 00:17:03.600
Kid, what I want for my reward is your food.

00:17:03.600 --> 00:17:05.640
My food?!

00:17:05.640 --> 00:17:09.310
You make me what I want when I want it.

00:17:09.310 --> 00:17:12.880
No matter what's goin' on, you make it then.

00:17:13.380 --> 00:17:16.280
That's my condition for helpin' out.

00:17:16.580 --> 00:17:19.720
Of course, I'll pay.

00:17:19.720 --> 00:17:22.620
Understood. I can do that much at least.

00:17:22.890 --> 00:17:25.020
I'll do it for the sake of 
getting the Mellow Cola,

00:17:25.020 --> 00:17:27.190
Toriko-san's training ingredient.

00:17:28.090 --> 00:17:29.060
But...

00:17:29.860 --> 00:17:32.190
I also have a condition!

00:17:32.190 --> 00:17:35.760
Why are you settin' a condition?!

00:17:35.760 --> 00:17:37.430
Zebra-san, you...

00:17:42.100 --> 00:17:46.280
Please don't senselessly kill 
any more living creatures!

00:17:46.480 --> 00:17:50.150
What's that?! You persistent little twerp!

00:17:50.150 --> 00:17:53.620
I don't mean to eat, but 
I want you to stop killing

00:17:53.620 --> 00:17:57.790
just because they tick you 
off or you want to fight!

00:17:57.790 --> 00:17:59.720
That's my condition!

00:18:06.260 --> 00:18:08.130
Fine.

00:18:08.530 --> 00:18:10.600
But I got a condition.

00:18:11.170 --> 00:18:12.630
Another one?

00:18:12.630 --> 00:18:16.500
The meal you make for me 
is gonna be free after all!

00:18:16.500 --> 00:18:19.270
In that case, I have another condition!

00:18:19.870 --> 00:18:24.780
I'm going to ask you to supply some 
ingredients, so please cooperate.

00:18:24.780 --> 00:18:27.050
In that case, I got a condition.

00:18:27.050 --> 00:18:31.190
You better never get cocky with me again!

00:18:31.190 --> 00:18:33.250
On one condition!

00:18:33.250 --> 00:18:35.120
I got another condition, too!

00:18:35.120 --> 00:18:36.360
So do I!

00:18:38.190 --> 00:18:39.430
Hey!

00:18:39.690 --> 00:18:41.800
The camels are ready!

00:18:41.800 --> 00:18:43.360
Hurry up!

00:18:44.330 --> 00:18:46.000
Kid...

00:18:46.800 --> 00:18:50.200
Have you really adapted to Toriko?

00:18:51.300 --> 00:18:54.270
I got one last condition.

00:18:54.270 --> 00:18:57.180
When we do get the Mellow Cola,

00:18:58.910 --> 00:19:01.380
you gotta become my partner.

00:19:02.220 --> 00:19:03.680
But I...

00:19:04.020 --> 00:19:08.250
You're a better match for me than Toriko.

00:19:08.450 --> 00:19:12.660
No two ways about it, you an' me 
could make the strongest combo ever.

00:19:15.230 --> 00:19:20.100
If I don't partner up with Zebra, we 
won't be able to get the Mellow Cola...?

00:19:22.670 --> 00:19:25.500
In that case, I have one condition!

00:19:40.950 --> 00:19:46.660
Kid, you're my reward this time...

00:19:46.660 --> 00:19:51.730
That thing did this to my reward...

00:19:52.260 --> 00:19:56.630
...and stole all the Mellow Cola!

00:20:02.070 --> 00:20:06.310
What the hell is it?!

00:20:09.580 --> 00:20:16.490
That thing's pissed me off so 
much, I'm full of energy again!

00:20:16.490 --> 00:20:20.220
There's a cocky creature around here!

00:20:35.570 --> 00:20:36.870
Good...

00:20:56.060 --> 00:20:58.090
Autophagy, huh?

00:20:58.090 --> 00:20:59.260
Yeah.

00:20:59.260 --> 00:21:05.170
A body that's burned through all its 
calories and feeds on its own cells.

00:21:05.170 --> 00:21:11.440
We've regained all our energy! The only 
thing, the time limit is five minutes.

00:21:12.370 --> 00:21:15.710
We've gotta eat something 
extremely delicious by then...

00:21:17.810 --> 00:21:19.580
Get back, Zebra.

00:21:20.180 --> 00:21:22.050
I've got this one.

00:21:22.050 --> 00:21:23.680
Up yours.

00:21:23.920 --> 00:21:30.490
I'm gonna be the one... that takes it out!

00:21:33.760 --> 00:21:35.830
Meteor Noise!

00:21:42.500 --> 00:21:45.140
17-fold...

00:21:50.680 --> 00:21:53.380
We give thanks for this food, let's eat!

00:21:57.580 --> 00:21:59.220
Yuuuu... Toriko!

00:21:59.220 --> 00:22:01.960
Potassium, manganese, calcium, 
starch, fructose, and dextrose

00:22:01.960 --> 00:22:04.790
Magnesium, iron, vitamins ABCDE

00:22:04.790 --> 00:22:07.630
Vanadium, sodium, glucosamine, chondroitin

00:22:07.630 --> 00:22:10.460
Carotintintin, lycopenpenpene, 
isoflavonvonvone

00:22:10.460 --> 00:22:13.200
Celery, goya, and green peas

00:22:13.200 --> 00:22:16.000
Shiitake, liver, eggplant, bell pepper

00:22:16.000 --> 00:22:18.700
What a shame to say "I don't 
even want to look at them!"

00:22:18.700 --> 00:22:20.370
Even if you hate it, gobble 
it down 3 times or 4 times

00:22:20.370 --> 00:22:21.810
and it'll be more and more

00:22:21.810 --> 00:22:23.140
Yuuuu... Toriko!

00:22:23.140 --> 00:22:25.950
Eat 'em up more! Eat 'em up more!

00:22:25.950 --> 00:22:28.810
More and more and more and 
more and more! Eat 'em all up!

00:22:28.810 --> 00:22:33.090
Delicious things are delicious!  
Not even giving them a chance…

00:22:33.090 --> 00:22:34.420
Such a waste!

00:22:34.420 --> 00:22:37.260
Gobble 'em down more! Gobble 'em down more!

00:22:37.260 --> 00:22:40.060
Majorly, deeply, plentifully, 
heartily, gobble 'em down!

00:22:40.060 --> 00:22:45.660
They enrich your body and spirit! 
Be grateful to your meals today!

00:22:45.660 --> 00:22:48.570
Thanks for the food! All done!

00:22:52.470 --> 00:22:56.210
Komatsu is gone, and they've lost the Mellow Cola.

00:22:57.010 --> 00:23:00.580
While battling against the mysterious creature that suddenly appeared,

00:23:00.580 --> 00:23:03.480
they are pushed to the edge by it's overwhelming power.

00:23:04.350 --> 00:23:07.810
As Toriko and Zebra face what seems like absolute doom...

00:23:07.810 --> 00:23:10.480
Both work together like never before!

00:23:11.400 --> 00:23:15.390
Explosion of Combination Techniques! We Get the World's Best Cola!

00:23:16.060 --> 00:23:17.860
Look forward to another heaping helping of fun!
